{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53355","headline":"杂句 四 · 庞藴","name":"杂句 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"思思低思思，自叹一双眉。\n向他胜地坐，万事总不知。\n六识若似眉，即得不思议。\n六识若嫌眉，论时没脑痴。\n伊若去却眉，即被世人欺。\n饶你六识喽罗汉，总成乞索儿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53355.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53355","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}